:INFO
Art. 182 Prosecution of infringements
1 The Federal Council shall coordinate the implementation of the Foodstuffs Act of 9 October 1992, the Customs Tariff Act of 18 March 2005 and this Act; in addition, it may require the Federal Tax Administration to pass on information.
2 The Federal Council shall set up a central office to investigate infringements concerning:
a. protected labelling for agricultural products;
b. the import, transit and export of agricultural products;
c. declaration of origin and production methods.
|

:NOTE
Art. 182 — Amended by No I of the FA of 20 June 2003, in force since 1 Jan. 2004 (AS 2003 4217; BBl 2002 4721, 7234).
